  "citation": "Ross S K; Moon J B; Klauss N; Masri B E; Runkle B R K; Stinchcomb G E (2025): Data from: \u201cBald Cypress (Taxodium distichum) Knees Are Methane Sources Controlled by Geomorphology, Climate, and Hydrologic Extremes\u201d. Methane dynamics described through vegetation-soil interactions in bald cypress and other bottomland hardwood forests. Dataset. doi:10.15485/2573729",
